---
name: container
type: registry:ui
title: Container
description: A centered content wrapper with max-width size variants.
dependencies:
  - tailwind-variants
files:
  - path: registry/items/components/container/container.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/container/container.svelte'
  - path: registry/items/components/container/container.types.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/container/container.types.ts'
  - path: registry/items/components/container/container.variants.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/container/container.variants.ts'
---

Use the container to constrain page or section content. Set `size` to `base`, `contained`, `thin`,
or `full`.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import Container from '~/components/container/container.svelte';
</script>

<Container size="thin">
	<p>Content goes here...</p>
</Container>
```
